  "name": "Nanbeige 4.2 (3B, Q4)",
  "description": "Nanbeige LLM Lab's compact agentic reasoning model. Its 3B label counts non-embedding parameters; total parameters are about 4B. The 22 transformer layers run twice over shared weights, with separate context caches. The Q4 download is 2.5 GiB, but one chat's FP16 context cache alone needs 5.5 GiB at 32K tokens or 11 GiB at 64K, plus model weights and engine overhead. Allow roughly 10 GiB of free GPU memory for a 32K, single-chat FP16 setup; longer context or more simultaneous chats needs substantially more headroom. Text-only, with native thinking, XML tool calling, English + Chinese, and support for up to 256K context when memory permits.",
